  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 16px 14px 24px; background-color: #fcfcfc; background-image: url(\u0026#34;data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABAAAAAQAQMAAAAlPW0iAAAABlBMVEX8/PzS0tLTnYHVAAAAEUlEQVR42mNggAEBBhwARQIAA2AAIbzCmO4AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\u0026#34;); background-repeat: repeat; background-size: 16px 16px; color: #111111; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere\" data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 3px solid #111111; padding: 16px 15px 20px; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #111111\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; display: table; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; background-color: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eCOMIC PANEL\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 12px 14px; background-color: #f5f5f5; border: 2px solid #111111\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #111111; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0\"\u003e粗黑分镜边框配经典漫画网点纸，不用一滴彩色油墨，单靠黑白反差就能讲出高能故事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; padding: 8px 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 2.5px solid #111111; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #111111; display: table; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table-cell; width: 64px; vertical-align: middle\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 2px 7px; background-color: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"margin-right: 2px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eEP.\u003c/span\u003e01\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; font-size: 17.5px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e把文章切成一格格高能分镜\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #111111; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0 0 15px\"\u003e外围网点纸托起\u003cstrong style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: 700\"\u003e3px 粗黑漫画分镜主框\u003c/strong\u003e，章节采用 EP.01 黑底白字与圆角对话气泡引用。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 14px 16px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 2.5px solid #111111; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #111111\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #111111; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0\"\u003e故事的节奏感，就藏在每一格分镜的停顿与反转里！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 4px; background-color: #111111; border: 2px solid #111111\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/minimal-architecture.jpg\" alt=\"强黑白光影对比的建筑几何构图\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\